sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to reboot the charging EVSE with status Immediate

    CSMS->>CS: ResetRequest (status Immediate, evseId = <Configured evseId>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message ResetRequest<br>- type Immediate<br>- evseId <Configured evseId>
    CS-->>CSMS: ResetResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Ended, triggerReason = ResetCommand, transactionInfo.chargingState = EVConnected, transactionInfo.stoppedReason = ImmediateReset)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
